 "polygon": [[2785.0, 3738.0], [3051.0, 3738.0], [3051.0, 3902.0], [2785.0, 3902.0]], "score": 0.999961793422699, "text": "375"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[851.0, 4028.0], [4563.0, 4086.0], [4561.0, 4240.0], [848.0, 4183.0]], "score": 0.9958876371383667, "text": "laissant un solde de 3.586 francs, assimilable à une prime de fusion."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[855.0, 4347.0], [5911.0, 4419.0], [5909.0, 4573.0], [853.0, 4502.0]], "score": 0.9934259057044983, "text": "La totalité des actions de la SA LESUEUR INVEST ayant été, préalablement à l'opération,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[855.0, 4516.0], [5669.0, 4573.0], [5667.0, 4728.0], [853.0, 4671.0]], "score": 0.9939476251602173, "text": "reprise par un actionnaire unique, il sera attribué à ce dernier la totalité des 250 actions"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[854.0, 4681.0], [1432.0, 4681.0], [1432.0, 4826.0], [854.0, 4826.0]], "score": 0.9997203946113586, "text": "nouvelles."}], "page": 60, "pdf": "63f1035e3f2ad069a6132806__63f1035e3f2ad069a6132806.pdf", "skew_angle": 0.0}